# Qwen3.6-35B-A3B, profile "dedicated": the GPU drives no display.
# 131k at q8_0/q8_0, the experts of 38 of 40 layers in RAM, ubatch 2048, MTP on: 7 374 MiB,
# 33.6 tok/s at 43k, prompts at ~700 tok/s. Measured in T-034, see docs/qwen36.md#the-profiles.
# The budget is a starting point by the rules in docs/agent.md#context-budget, not yet measured
# in a session: BUDGET twice Bonsai's for a model that spends ~90 % of its output thinking.
: "${CTX:=131072}"
: "${CPU_MOE:=38}"
: "${UB:=2048}"
: "${BUDGET:=16384}"
: "${MAX_TOKENS:=32000}"
: "${RESERVE_TOKENS:=32000}"
: "${KEEP_RECENT_TOKENS:=24000}"
